wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\"><img alt=\"Cheese\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cheese_fd71d6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">6 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\"><img alt=\"Ham\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ham_25e33a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">8 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\"><img alt=\"Meat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meat_7cb26b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\"><img alt=\"Mug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mug_0b9899.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a><sup>1</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\"><img alt=\"Mug\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mug_0b9899.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">Mug</a><sup>2</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Beer\">Beer</a>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-2\">With <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20%28Liquid%29\">Water</a>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Swolt.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nSwolt: Hello.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a></b><br/>\nSwolt: The Farmine project is a spark of hope for the whole dwarvenhood. The resources here might lead the dwarfs to a new golden age.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a></b><br/>\nSwolt: Ah, home sweet home! Though I don't mind being here for a while, my heart still belongs to Kazordoon. ...<br/>\nSwolt: In a few decades, I'll certainly return there and hand over this tavern to someone else.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>tavern</b><br/>\nSwolt: Every dwarf needs some relaxation now and then. This is the place where the miners come to share stories about home and hear news about the latest events like the giant beaver rodeos.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>giant beaver rodeos</b><br/>\nSwolt: If you need to ask, you don't need to know.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Excalibug</b><br/>\nSwolt: The cousin of my mother's neighbour knows someone who claims to have seen a strange guy in the Kazordoon tavern. He was wearing a dark cloak and beneath it he hid a weapon that might have been Excalibug.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>orcs</b><br/>\nSwolt: If the orcs come here to kill us, we will be prepared! They will pay heavily for every attack.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>minotaurs</b><br/>\nSwolt: It wouldn't surprise me if there were another minotaur city somewhere on this continent. They are a pest.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>lizards</b><br/>\nSwolt: Dragonkin! You can't expect anything good from dragons and the likes of them.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nSwolt: Bye.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Swolt</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest","tomes-of-knowledge-quest"],"pos":{"x":32994,"y":31541,"z":10}}